TI  - Agentic AI Security in IoMT: A PRISMA-Guided Scoping Review and Layered Threat-Defense Taxonomy
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 International Conference on Cybersecurity, Digital Forensics, and AI Applications, ICCSDFAI 2026
SP  - 991
EP  - 996
DO  - 10.1109/ICCSDFAI70505.2026.11647867
