AB  - Use SARF to combine agents, RL, and LLMs in secure SaaS. We gain protection in multi-tenant spaces. This framework merges AI reasoning with safety protocols for the organization. SARF agents plan and adapt alone. The data stays private. We enforce zero-trust rules through these autonomous systems consistently. Three modules form your system. Agentic LLM Core (ALC) manages reasoning plus tools. Reinforcement Orchestration Layer (ROL) optimizes your policies within set limits. Security Sentinel Network (SSN) detects threats and ensures safety. These components work together. We manage complex tasks through this structure. Privacy-preserving RL pipelines update models. To avoid sharing raw data. Homomorphic encryption and differential privacy shield the sensible information. Secure updates happen. n8n workflow tools add automation. To see clear execution paths. Human-in-the-loop controls give you total oversight. Traceable logs help. Tests on SaaS document data prove success. SARF shows 94% accuracy plus 89% anomaly detection rate. The face zero leakage during stress tests. Performance beats LLM-only and rule-based systems across these evaluations. © The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Switzerland AG 2026.
