TI  - Securing the Physical-Digital Frontier: AI for Anomaly Detection in OT, IoT, and Critical Infrastructure
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 International Conference on Cybersecurity, Digital Forensics, and AI Applications, ICCSDFAI 2026
SP  - 945
